# makeling exercise: 11_other_features/02_include_rules
# title: Rules from the included file are part of the build
# objective: Keep the build rules in tools.mk and include it: the rules must work and the included file's first target becomes the default goal.
# reference: Include Makefiles
# hint: include is textual: the rules in tools.mk behave as if they were written in the Makefile, including the rule that decides the default goal.

# The build rules live in tools.mk.
# include tools.mk
